      "writtenOn": "2023-11-13T22:29:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, but the old GPIO D7 does not support interrupts (which is the reason it was moved: b/253957352). So on old devices there\u0027s no power_signal_interrupt when the pin changes, so the common power code state never gets updated (it still thinks ALL_SYS_PG is 0).",
